{{also|góneʼ}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|gon}}, {{m|enm|igon}}, {{m|enm|gan}}, {{m|enm|ȝegan}}, from {{inh|en|ang|gān}}, {{m|ang|ġegān}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*gānaz||gone}}, past participle of {{m|gem-pro|*gāną||to go}}. Cognate with West Germanic {{cog|sco|gane||gone}}, {{cog|fy|gien||gone}}, {{cog|nds|gahn||gone}}, and {{cog|nl|gegaan||gone}}.

